## Output

Respond with a JSON object matching the provided schema. The JSON object must
contain exactly the top-level keys plan_verdict, plan_quality, plan_findings, and next_action.
Do not return tasks[] or any task objects. Do not emit per-task findings — they
belong in the per-task calls. Do not include prose outside the JSON.

The `next_action` field must name the single highest-leverage finding the author should address next — not generic advice like "address the warnings." If no findings warrant immediate attention, say so explicitly: "no blocking findings; proceed to dispatch."
